  https://github.com/noah-chelednik/voynich-data/blob/main/LICENSE

Underlying transcription data:
  This dataset is derived from scholarly transcriptions of the Voynich
  Manuscript (Beinecke MS 408, Yale University) that are publicly
  distributed for research, primarily the Zandbergen-Landini (ZL)
  transcription from https://www.voynich.nu/. The transcription authors
  have not published explicit license statements.

  This dataset is therefore released as a RESEARCH RESOURCE:

  1. Research and educational use is the intended purpose.
  2. Cite the original transcribers in any published work
     (see the Citation section of the dataset card).
  3. For commercial applications, verify rights independently and
     contact the transcription authors.

  Full provenance for all transcription sources:
  https://github.com/noah-chelednik/voynich-data/blob/main/docs/SOURCES_LICENSE.md

The manuscript itself is in the public domain. Images of the manuscript
are provided by the Beinecke Rare Book & Manuscript Library.
